    "question": {
      "en": "A number when divided by $13$ leaves a remainder of $11$. What is the remainder when the same number is divided by $26$?",
      "hi": "एक संख्या को $13$ से विभाजित करने पर $11$ शेषफल प्राप्त होता है। जब उसी संख्या को $26$ से विभाजित किया जाए तो शेषफल क्या होगा?"
    },
    "options": "<span class=\"lang-en\">Difficulty: Medium | Target time: 45 sec</span>\n                    <span class=\"lang-hi\">कठिनाई: मध्यम | लक्ष्य समय: 45 सेकंड</span>",
    "solution": {
      "en": "Let the number = $13k + 11$ for some whole number $k$.<br><br>\n                            If $k$ is even (say $k = 2m$):<br>\n                            $\\text{Number} = 13(2m) + 11 = 26m + 11 \\to \\text{Remainder} = \\mathbf{11}$<br><br>\n                            If $k$ is odd (say $k = 2m+1$):<br>\n                            $\\text{Number} = 13(2m+1) + 11 = 26m + 13 + 11 = 26m + 24 \\to \\text{Remainder} = \\mathbf{24}$<br><br>\n                            <strong>Remainder = 11 or 24</strong> (both are possible depending on the value of $k$).",
      "hi": ""
    }
  },
